## /usr/local/etc/nanorc - the system-wide settings of nano on Atari
## System V / AMIX (atari-sysv-sp1).  ~/.nanorc adds to them.
## The terminal is Latin-1 (no UTF-8 locale here); colours need a TERM
## whose terminfo has them (xterm-color, xterm-xfree86), ASV's xterm has none.

## Syntax colouring for the usual file types
include "/usr/local/share/nano/*.nanorc"
